    "https://www.alfred.edu/jobs-at-alfred/index.cfm": {
      "title": "Jobs",
      "description": "Jobs at Alfred | Alfred University Skip To Top Navigation Skip To Content Skip To Footer Apply Visit Request Info Give Search Search alfred.edu Search alfred.edu Menu Close Search alfred.edu Search alfred.edu About Academics Admissions & Aid Student Life Athletics Information for Prospective Students Accepted Students Families & Parents Visitors Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Research & Business Partners Job Seekers High School Counselors Quick Links Request Info Apply Visit Blog News Events MyAU Directory Give Bookstore Libraries Our Promise Jobs at Alfred Home jobs-at-alfred Jobs at Alfred Back To Home Job Opportunities at Alfred University Opportunities at Alfred University are more than jobs; here at AU we are a community working to provide an incredible education and student experience for every individual we serve. Whether you join our faculty or facilities staff, you will find a place where people work hard and genuinely care about a mission that we can only accomplish together. Explore the list of opportunities below, and apply to join our team and start your own Alfred Experience. Alfred University is committed to an anti-discrimination policy in all of its programs and services. Contact Information Alfred University Office of Human Resources Greene Hall Alfred, NY 14802 Email Christine Harris Human Resources Specialist 1 Saxon Drive Alfred, NY 14802 607-871-2111 Maps & Directions Emergency Information Request Info Visit Us Apply Now Top Information For Prospective Students Accepted Students Families & Parents Visitors Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Research & Business Partners Job Seekers High School Counselors Policies Privacy Policy Anti-Discrimination Policy Accessibility Title IX Top Copyright © 2026 Alfred University | Site Map Top"
