    "https://alfreduniversity.applytojob.com/apply/4JInK3fHvK/Per-Diem-Driver?source=Our Career Page Widget": {
      "title": "Per Diem Driver",
      "description": "Per Diem Driver - Alfred University - Career Page Skip To Job Description View All Jobs View Our Website Thanks for visiting our Career Page. Please review our open positions and apply to the positions that match your qualifications. To learn more about how Alfred University is Outside of Ordinary, please visit our website. If you need assistance, please contact Tamara Green, by emailing [email protected] or calling 607-871-2965. Per Diem Driver Alfred, NY Part Time Motorpool Services Entry Level Share This driving position consists of shuttling students, and trustees to and from local airports, train stations and bus stops such as Rochester, Elmira, and occasionally Buffalo. Also, may include student field trips, local campus shuttles, and other tasks where a driver is needed. Salary/Rate: $20.00 per hour; $30 per hour for drivers driving after 1AM Qualifications: Must have at least a class “D” license, with minimal infractions, and submit to a license check Must have at least one year of driving experience and be comfortable with up to 14 passengers Must have a cellular phone available, and the ability to map and find locations Must be comfortable with inner-city traffic situations and maneuverability Alfred University actively subscribes to a policy of equal employment opportunity, and will not discriminate against any employee, student or applicant because of race, age, sex, color, sexual orientation, gender identification or expression, physical or mental disability, religion, ancestry or national origin, marital status, genetic information, military or veteran status, domestic violence victim status, criminal conviction status, political affiliation or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Share Apply Apply for this position Required * First Name * Last Name * Email Address * Phone * Address * Resume * We've received your resume. Click here to update it. Attach resume or Paste resume Attach resume as .pdf, .doc, .docx, .od